["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">帳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>笔记本；账本；相册；帘幕；帐篷</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とばり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">通帳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つうちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">存折；银行存折</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">手帳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">笔记本；便签本；（袖珍）日记本；证书；证件；身份证明卡</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">帳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とばり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">窗帘；帷幕；帐幔；（黑暗、神秘等的）帷幕；笼罩；夜幕</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">悔</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>后悔；懊悔；悔恨</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">く.いる・く.やむ・くや.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">悔しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くやしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">懊悔的；遗憾的；沮丧的；恼火的；气恼的；令人沮丧的；令人恼火的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">悔やむ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くやむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">哀悼；悲叹；懊悔；遗憾；悔恨</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">後悔</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">后悔；悔恨；悔意</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">諭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>劝诫；警告；责备；说服；训导</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さと.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">惨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>悲惨；残酷；灾难；残忍</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サン・ザン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みじ.め・いた.む・むご.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">悲惨</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">悲惨的；不幸的；可悲的；可怜的；惨不忍睹的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">虐</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>虐待；压迫</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギャク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しいた.げる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">翻</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>翻译；翻转；飘动；改变（主意）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホン・ハン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひるがえ.る・ひるがえ.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">翻訳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほんやく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">翻译；译文；破译；解码；（生物）翻译（依据信使核糖核酸合成蛋白质）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">墜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>坠落；掉落</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ツイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.ちる・お.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">墜落</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ついらく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">坠落；（飞机等）失事</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">沼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>沼泽；池塘；湿地</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ぬま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">沼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぬま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">沼泽；湿地；泥沼；池塘；痴迷；沉溺；上瘾；丑男；相貌丑陋的男人；智障；精神残疾人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">据</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>设置；安装；坐下；蹲下；奠定基础</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.える・す.わる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">据える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">放置；固定；安设（如桌子）；奠基；安置；使就座；确定；凝定（如目光）；施灸；行艾灸</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">据え付ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すえつける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">安装；装配；固定；设置</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">肥</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>肥料；使肥沃；变胖；养胖；肥沃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こ.える・こえ・こ.やす・こ.やし・ふと.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">肥料</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">肥料；粪肥；堆肥</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">徐</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>徐缓；缓慢；从容；渐渐</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おもむ.ろに</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">徐々に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょじょに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">逐渐；稳步；缓慢；一点一点；循序渐进；逐步</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">徐行</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缓行；减速行驶；慢速行进</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">徐々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缓慢；逐渐；平稳；沉着；镇定；从容</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">糖</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>糖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">砂糖</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">糖；砂糖</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">搭</div><div class=\"k-body\