=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">滝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>瀑布；急流；跌水</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ・ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">滝</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">瀑布；急流；险滩</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">軌</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>轨道；车辙；规范；做法</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">軌道</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">轨道；运行轨迹；铁路轨道；铁轨；正轨；正确轨道</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">俵</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>袋子；草包；麻袋；捆包；（用于计数袋子的）量词</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たわら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">土俵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どひょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（相扑）土俵；摔跤场；（讨论等的）场所；舞台；沙袋；土工袋；石笼</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">妨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>妨碍；阻碍；干扰；阻止</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さまた.げる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">妨げる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さまたげる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">妨碍；阻止；阻挡；妨害</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">妨害</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼうがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">妨碍；阻挡；干扰；破坏</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">擦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>摩擦；擦伤；磨碎；刮擦；蹭</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.る・す.れる・-ず.れ・こす.る・こす.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">擦る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かする</span><span class=\"k-wz\">擦过；轻触；划伤；提成；抽取佣金；剥削；榨取</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">摩擦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（物理）摩擦；摩擦；擦；蹭；摩擦；不和；纷争；冲突</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">擦れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">摩擦；磨损；磨损；穿旧；失去天真；变得老练；变得圆滑</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鯨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>鲸鱼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くじら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">捕鯨</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほげい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">捕鲸；猎鲸；鲸鱼捕捞</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">荘</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>别墅；旅馆；庄园；封建领地；庄严</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ・ショウ・チャン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほうき・おごそ.か</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">別荘</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">べっそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">度假屋；度假别墅；别墅；监狱；牢狱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">諾</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>同意；承诺；应允</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ダク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">承諾</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうだく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">同意；批准；接受；赞成；遵从</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">雷</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>雷；闪电；地雷；水雷</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ライ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かみなり・いかずち・いかづち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いかずち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">闪电；雷；霹雳</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">漂</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>漂浮；漂流；漂白</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ただよ.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">漂う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ただよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">漂浮；飘浮；飘散；弥漫；弥漫；笼罩；漂泊；四处游荡；不稳定；摇晃不定；动摇；退缩；畏缩；（古语）生活不安定；境遇飘摇不定</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">懐</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>胸怀；怀念；亲近；怀旧；怀藏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ・エ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふところ・なつ.かしい・なつ.かしむ・なつ.く・なつ.ける・なず.ける・いだ.く・おも.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">懐かしい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なつかしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">令人怀念的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">懐く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なつく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">亲近；驯服；变得亲密；感情上靠近</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">勘</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>直觉；感知；核对；比较；第六感</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勘</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">知觉；直觉；第六感</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勘定</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">计算；计数；核算；账单；账目；结账；付款；体谅；照顾；考虑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勘違い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんちがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">误会；误解；错误的想法</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">栽</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>种植；栽培</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">栽培</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいばい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">栽培；种植；培养</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">拐</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>拐骗；绑架</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">駄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>驮运（用马等牲口负载）；驮马；琐碎；无价值；笨重</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ダ・タ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">無駄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むだ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">徒劳；浪费；无用；无意义；闲散</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">下駄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げた</span><span class=\"k-wz\">木屐；传统日式木质凉鞋；活字印刷校对中的倒置字符；转向字；（围棋）枷；枷吃</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">駄作</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ださく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劣作；拙作；垃圾作品</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">添</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>附加；伴随；添加；满足；装饰</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そ.える・そ.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">添う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">满足；符合；达到；不负（期望等）；伴随；陪同；跟随；与...同行；结交；交往；混在一起；成婚；结婚；娶；嫁；被添加；被加入</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">添える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">附上；添上；配上（如礼物附卡片）；点缀（菜肴）；添加支撑；支托；陪同；伴随（作为辅助、导游、翻译等）；模仿；效仿；靠近；贴近</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">冠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>冠帽；桂冠；居首；成年礼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かんむり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冠</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんむり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">神道教士和廷臣佩戴的传统帽子；王冠；皇冠；冠冕；汉字的冠部首；字头；俳谐的首句；最优的；无与伦比的；第一的；名称；头衔；冠名赞助；（将棋）冠（头衔数的量词）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">斜</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>倾斜；斜向；斜线</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シャ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なな.め・はす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">斜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">斜线；对角线</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">斜め</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ななめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">斜的；倾斜的；对角线的；斜向的；扭曲的；偏颇的；不正常的；乖戾的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">傾斜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">倾斜；斜面；坡度；斜度；倾侧；倾角；歪斜；偏斜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">鏡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>镜子；镜面；镜饼（圆年糕）；酒桶盖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ・ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かがみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">眼鏡</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">がんきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">眼镜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鏡</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かがみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">镜子；镜面；桶盖；文件首页说明（注明目的、日期、作者等）；镜饼；镜形年糕</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">顕微鏡</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんびきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">显微镜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">聡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>聪慧；领悟快</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さと.い・みみざと.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">浪</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>波浪；放浪；放纵；汹涌；鲁莽</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-j